  - m_Id: 321032192
    m_Localized: 'Cash: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 388141056
    m_Localized: Blue = industry, red = town, purple = road station, teal = rail
      station. Primary industries fill stations; town deliveries are consumed (not
      stocked). Factories need inputs. V buys a starter truck at the selected road
      station (idle until you set a route). C buys a starter locomotive at the selected
      rail station (add wagons in Vehicles). L opens vehicles; U opens unlocks; I
      industries; T towns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
